  "dryrun": {
    "_comment": "Assumptions of `fart social dryrun` (milestone 6, no HTTP) while social_posts has no history: posts per UTC day the mega query returns (elonmusk replies included) and the KOL batch returns, and the share of confirmation counts that reach search_when_count_1h and trigger a search. Once the daemon ran, the command uses the observed rates of social_posts over the last 7 days and says so; replace these guesses by the observed figures in a commit (not a rule file).",
